sequenceDiagram
  actor S as Intern
  participant A as chabot-assistant
  participant I as intership-service
  participant O as Ollama
  participant D as chabot_assistant_db
  S->>A: POST /api/ai/missions/{id}/chat
  A->>I: GET /missions/{id}/ai-context
  I-->>A: mission and documents, if it concerns their team
  opt document not indexed yet
    A->>A: extracts the text, chunks of 900 characters
    A->>O: nomic-embed-text on each chunk
    A->>D: stores the chunks and their vectors
  end
  A->>O: embedding of the question
  A->>A: cosine similarity, best 6 passages
  A->>D: reads the latest messages
  A->>O: qwen3:0.6b, context and passages
  O-->>A: JSON answer with answer and scope
  A->>D: stores the question and the answer
  A-->>S: answer, or refusal if off topic
